1
00:00:00,661 --> 00:00:04,331
(Spock:)Trust me, it gets old after a while.

2
00:00:06,292 --> 00:00:07,962
(Spock:)You must right your wrong, Sheldon.

3
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:13,800
(Sheldon:)Leonard has his toy,
and he's never going to open it.

4
00:00:14,008 --> 00:00:17,508
(Sheldon:)So he won't know it's broken.
And I have a toy that isn't broken.

5
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:18,970
(Sheldon:)Everybody's happy.

6
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,760
(Spock:)Well, I am unhappy.

7
00:00:20,973 --> 00:00:23,723
l thought where you come from
they don't have emotions.

8
00:00:24,477 --> 00:00:28,017
(Spock:)I come from a factory in Taiwan.

9
00:00:29,357 --> 00:00:30,687
(Spock:)Now, do the right thing.

10
00:00:31,192 --> 00:00:32,522
(Sheldon:)You know what you are?

11
00:00:32,735 --> 00:00:35,655
Well, you're a green-blooded buzzkill.

12
00:00:35,863 --> 00:00:37,953
(Sheldon:)Perhaps it's time you beam on
out of here.

13
00:00:38,157 --> 00:00:41,037
(Spock:)Fine. I will just use the Transporter.

14
00:00:41,244 --> 00:00:44,744
(Spock:)Oh, right, you broke it.

15
00:00:46,249 --> 00:00:50,709
(Sheldon:)Very well. Cooper to Enterprise,
one to beam up.

16
00:00:50,920 --> 00:01:02,020
Energize.

